# Build context for runtimes/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Allow-list: only the v2 sources go into the image; secrets, git history and the old bot never do.
*
!core/
!runtimes/package.json
!runtimes/docker/
runtimes/docker/*.md
runtimes/docker/Dockerfile*
runtimes/docker/compose.yaml
